DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The kkbbddmmuuxx keyboard driver provides support for basic keyboard multiplex‐
     ing.  It is built around the idea of a “super keyboard”.  The kkbbddmmuuxx
     driver acts as a master keyboard consuming input from all slave keyboards
     attached to it.

     Slave keyboards can be attached to or detached from the kkbbddmmuuxx keyboard
     driver with the kbdcontrol(1) utility.

