AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     Maksim Yevmenkin <_m___e_v_m_e_n_k_i_n_@_y_a_h_o_o_._c_o_m>

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The kkbbddmmuuxx keyboard driver switches all slave keyboards into K_RAW mode.
     Thus all slave keyboards attached to the kkbbddmmuuxx keyboard share the same
     state.  The kkbbddmmuuxx keyboard is logically equivalent to one keyboard with
     lots of duplicated keys.

